// Stand-in benchmark until the kickoff dataset exists: questions about THIS repo's own code and docs.
// Corpus: `make index-bench` (~100 chunks in data/bench.sqlite), so retrieval is tested (top_k << corpus).
// Run: `make eval-bench`. Every answer below was checked against the source.
